/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> <strong>resources</strong> in the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return</strong> to your base alive with your trapped monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprison &amp; farm &amp; sell</strong> the monsters in your basement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow cursed crops</strong> to feed your monsters to produce dark resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill monsters</strong> and use them to feed your caged monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice altar</strong> to create upgrades by sacrificing monsters using dark magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare variations</strong> of monsters: shiny/aggressive/photosensitive/gluttonous!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow baby monsters</strong> that run around in your basement from rare eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw magic sigils\u00a0</strong>to capture monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer disturbing voice calls</strong> from potential monster buyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> your basement, gear, and creature cages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 3+ dungeons</strong> and dive deeper &amp; capture scarier and more valuable monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> the feeding and collecting of resources from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon modifiers</strong>\u00a0to find mid-run that completely change the dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret portals</strong> and other entrances within dungeons leading to secret dungeons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or singleplayer, 1-4 players!</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tbjbu2"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descrip